  "keyFeatures": [
    "Dynamic product catalog with variants, color/size selectors, and progressive filtering",
    "Multi-gateway payment processing (Stripe, Paddle, PayPal) with subscription billing",
    "Full CMS site builder with TinyMCE, shortcodes, and reusable list menus",
    "Multi-warehouse inventory management with CSV bulk import and webhook sync",
    "Priority-based discount engine with BOGO, coupons, and wholesale pricing tiers",
    "VAT-inclusive pricing with cross-border VAT removal for international buyers",
    "Built-in helpdesk ticketing and knowledge base with AI article writer",
    "Extensible plugin system for display widgets and real-time shipping carriers (FedEx, UPS, USPS)",
    "Dynamic email notification templates with merge tags and TinyMCE editor",
    "Advanced shop search with multi-attribute filtering, price range sliders, and URL sync",
    "Events calendar plugin with product variant-level event scheduling",
    "Cross-selling engine with post-cart intermediary pages",
    "CMS downloads manager supporting local, S3, and CDN file delivery with Video.js player",
    "Database-driven navigation builder with drag-and-drop, mega menus, and color schemes",
    "Multilingual content with AI-powered auto-translation via OpenAI"
  ],
